{"page":"/docs/std/:module","title":"std/time — Vyrn","props":{"name":"time","intro":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>Wall-clock time at the host boundary, and a pure calendar breakdown.</p><p><code>now()</code> and <code>monotonic()</code> are host effects, so generators and comptime code cannot call them; the parity harness fixes the clock with <code>VYRN_FIXED_TIME</code>. The calendar breakdown and the formatters are pure. UTC only: no timezone database, no DST, no locale. Milliseconds since the Unix epoch, UTC. A distinct type, so a timestamp does not mix with a plain count.</p>"},"entries":[{"name":"Instant","kind":"type","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">type</span> <span class=\"t\">Instant</span> = <span class=\"t\">Int64</span> <span class=\"k\">where</span> value &gt;= <span class=\"n\">0</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>Milliseconds since the Unix epoch, UTC. A distinct type, so a timestamp does not mix with a plain count.</p>"},"line":10},{"name":"Civil","kind":"type","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">type</span> <span class=\"t\">Civil</span> = { year: <span class=\"t\">Int64</span>, month: <span class=\"t\">Int64</span>, day: <span class=\"t\">Int64</span> }"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>A UTC calendar date, the pure breakdown of an <code>Instant</code>&#39;s day component.</p>"},"line":13},{"name":"now","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">now</span>() -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>The current wall-clock instant.</p>"},"line":23},{"name":"monotonic","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">monotonic</span>() -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Int64</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>Monotonic nanoseconds, for durations: <code>now()</code> jumps when the wall clock is set.</p>"},"line":29},{"name":"toMillis","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">toMillis</span>(i: <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Int64</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":""},"line":33},{"name":"fromMillis","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">fromMillis</span>(n: <span class=\"t\">Int64</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>An instant from raw epoch milliseconds, validated non-negative.</p>"},"line":38},{"name":"civil","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">civil</span>(i: <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Civil</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>The UTC calendar date (year/month/day) of an instant.</p>"},"line":59},{"name":"year","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">year</span>(i: <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Int64</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>The UTC year of an instant.</p>"},"line":64},{"name":"month","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">month</span>(i: <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Int64</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>The UTC month of an instant (1..12).</p>"},"line":69},{"name":"day","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">day</span>(i: <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Int64</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>The UTC day-of-month of an instant (1..31).</p>"},"line":74},{"name":"hour","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">hour</span>(i: <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Int64</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>The UTC hour of an instant (0..23).</p>"},"line":79},{"name":"minute","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">minute</span>(i: <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Int64</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>The UTC minute of an instant (0..59).</p>"},"line":85},{"name":"second","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">second</span>(i: <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Int64</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>The UTC second of an instant (0..59).</p>"},"line":91},{"name":"format","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">format</span>(i: <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">String</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>UTC timestamp <code>YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS</code>.</p>"},"line":118},{"name":"formatIso","kind":"fn","sig":{"TrustedMarkup":"<span class=\"k\">fn</span> <span class=\"f\">formatIso</span>(i: <span class=\"t\">Instant</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">String</span>"},"prose":{"TrustedMarkup":"<p>ISO-8601 UTC timestamp <code>YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ</code>.</p>"},"line":126}]},"params":{"module":"time"}}